\f1\b0 \cb3 \'a0Yeah. Okay, let\'92s\'85 We talked a lot about\'85 We talked a lot about a lot of things. Certainly about the things that were exciting last year. But this year one of the things you guys mentioned that\'92s exciting is the scaling of text diffusion models, and just a different exploration of text diffusion. Can you talk about what that is and what the possibility it holds?\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

